## Done when

- Every question is answered or deferred to `docs/DECISION-QUEUE.md`, and
  `node scripts/params.mjs` lists only parameters that were deliberately deferred.
- Every document whose questions were all answered is `ratified` (or `not-applicable` with a
  reason), with `owner` and `last-reviewed` set.
- Every answer with a real alternative has an ADR, and every ADR written is `accepted` or
  explicitly left `proposed`.
- `node scripts/check.mjs` passes.
